#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Buffer-Backends/Writing-a-Buffer-Compatible-Conversions-Package.rst:4
msgid ""
"**Goal:** Learn how to create a ``*_conversions`` package that maps between "
"a ROS 2 message containing ``uint8[]`` payload fields and a library-specific "
"native type, while preserving compatibility with ``rosidl::Buffer`` storage "
"backends."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Buffer-Backends/Writing-a-Buffer-Compatible-Conversions-Package.rst:9
msgid "**Tutorial level:** Advanced"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Buffer-Backends/Writing-a-Buffer-Compatible-Conversions-Package.rst:11
msgid "**Time:** 30+ minutes"
msgstr ""

