#: ../../../source/ROS-Framework/interfaces/Working-with-interfaces/Buffer-Backends/Writing-a-Buffer-Compatible-Conversions-Package.rst:212
msgid ""
"``from_output_tensor_msg()`` to create a writable ``at::Tensor`` view over a "
